Z||000004||avengador1||12-07-2001||07:24 PM||||The tank is not only for overflow but for recovery of coolant fluid. When the engine cools down it will suck air back into your cooling system if you don't have an overflow tank or your tank is empty of fluid.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
